tps://soundcloud.com/search?q=Stein", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Stein", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=Stein", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Stein", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Stein&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["“Ended off with some new tracks by Stein.”"]}], "counts": {"high": 3, "mid": 8, "low": 7}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:08:42", "end": "00:09:31", "text": "You are listening to Saturday Sunset with Dot Zip. Before we start, I want to acknowledge that we are broadcasting from stolen Aboriginal land, Gadigal land, in Redfern, Waterloo. Always was, always will be Aboriginal land, Sovereignty Never Ceded. Myself, Sob Black Pussy, in the studio with Rydeen. She's starting us off tonight for the next two hours. We'll be here until eight o'clock. That first track was from Oakland Duo, Zalin, Baudelaide and her beautiful wife Off of their new record that they released a few days ago, Dyke Den That track was called Girl to Girl Saturday Sunset with Dot Tip"}, {"start": "00:30:33", "end": "00:31:12", "text": "You are listening to Saturday Sunset with Dot Zip. Rydeen in the mix at the moment. We've been having some big blends. Under us is one of our tracks, Copycat Emo Mix off of our EP Don't Tell Anyone. Before that, we heard a track by Nina off of his new record. We had a bit of Daniel Panetta, his latest EP Landlock, which was released on Club Romantico. Very excited for all the new."}, {"start": "01:18:04", "end": "01:19:04", "text": "You are listening to Saturday Sunset with Dot Zip. Got Rydeen in the mix, myself, SOVBLKPSSY. Played a few tracks before. Some newer kind of US club stuff. Some new releases from Black Rafe Culture, as well as Bay Area Producers, Board Lord and Richard, their latest collaboration together. under us is a new one from dj swisher and tar back and forth off of his recent release best of luck got like 40 minutes of the show left so if you're enjoying it text in 0435 123 945 we're here until eight o'clock"}, {"start": "01:26:32", "end": "01:26:47", "text": "Vente pa'ca, pa'ca, ide, take, take, suelto pa'ca, pa'ca, quien nos ata, sata. Vente pa'ca, pa'ca, ide, take, suelto pa'ca, pa'ca, quien nos ata, sata."}, {"start": "01:56:48", "end": "01:57:13", "text": "You've been listening to Saturday Sunset with Dot Zip. Myself, SobbackPussy and Rydeen in the mix tonight. Ended off with some new tracks by Stein. Absolutely love those. We'll probably play them out the next couple of gigs we have. We'll be here again next week, next weekend, same time, six to eight o'clock."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Fast Fast (feat. Roscosteazy, Optimist Music ZA & JussGigi)", "artists": [{"name": "031choppa"}, {"name": "Al Xapo & Benzoo"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:07"}, "track": {"title": "Girl 2 Girl", "artists": [{"name": "Darlynn (Daria Lourd aka Bored Lord & Jaelynn Walls)"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:23:25"}, "track": {"title": "Landlock", "artists": [{"name": "Daniel Panetta"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:25:42"}, "track": {"title": null, "artists": [{"name": "Nina"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:28:08"}, "track": {"title": "Copycat Emo Mix", "artists": [{"name": "Dot Zip"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:31:44"}, "track": {"title": "South London", "artists": [{"name": "Black Rave Culture & Bok Bok"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:37:07"}, "track":